!Sample_data_processing = https://github.com/ENCODE-DCC/chip-seq-pipeline
!Sample_data_processing = Map reads with BWA-0.7.12
!Sample_data_processing = Post-alignment filtering steps were carried out using samtools-1.355 with MAPQ threshold of 30
!Sample_data_processing = Duplicate removal was performed using picard-tools-1.88
!Sample_data_processing = Peak enrichment were computed using phantompeakqualtools  implementing the SPP algorithm
!Sample_data_processing = Replicate consistency and peak ranking determined by irreproducible discovery rate (IDR) using the IDR-2.0.2 tool
